# 🔒 Security & Compliance

## Secrets
- Never hardcode secrets, API keys, credentials
- Always use environment variables

## Data Privacy
- GDPR/CCPA compliance: minimal collection, explicit purpose, secure storage

## Auth
- Validate tokens server-side
- Never trust client-side state
- Proper session management
